From d62c01d34e07e7fb705470bfed1c6ac8bdbe5dba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nicolas Le Bayon <nicolas.le.bayon@foss.st.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Apr 2026 23:22:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 368/913] drivers: stm32_risaf: refactor configuration
 functions

Factorize source code around region and subregion configuration
functions by passing structure pointers instead of unitary
variables for each parameter. Prefer to extract them directly
within the functions.
Implement a save/restore mechanism in stm32_risaf_reconfigure_area()
in case of error to keep consistency.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 4ec50f8ed3d3d733dda833af8c32a28e3244113e drivers: stm32_risaf: refactor configuration functions]
Signed-off-by: Nicolas Le Bayon <nicolas.le.bayon@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I341f6b6a0adbd42357e07a02ead7d767f6de33ae
---
